#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">CRM:</font></b> Manage your customer "
"relationships and pipelines."
msgstr ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">CRM:</font></b> ຄຸ້ມຄອງສາຍພົວພັນລູກຄ້າ ແລະ "
"ຂັ້ນຕອນການຂາຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Project:</font></b> Build your project "
"foundation for prototyping and reuse it for all subsequent stages."
msgstr ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ໂຄງການ:</font></b> "
"ສ້າງພື້ນຖານໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບການສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບ ແລະ ນຳກັບມາໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໃນທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ມາ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Purchase:</font></b> Track supplier orders "
"and manage your entire procurement history."
msgstr ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ການຈັດຊື້:</font></b> ຕິດຕາມໃບສັ່ງຊື້ຈາກຜູ້ສະໜອງ ແລະ "
"ຄຸ້ມຄອງປະຫວັດການຈັດຊື້ທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Audit Trail:</b> Keep every modification visible to ensure full "
"transparency throughout the product's development cycle."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຮ່ອງຮອຍການກວດສອບ:</b> ສະແດງທຸກການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຕະຫຼອດວົງຈອນການພັດທະນາຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Automated MTO (Make to Order):</b> Enable the <b>MTO route</b> on semi-"
"finished products. This automatically triggers a linked secondary MO the "
"moment the main manufacturing order is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"<b>MTO ອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຜະລິດເມື່ອມີຄຳສັ່ງຊື້):</b> ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ <b>ເສັ້ນທາງ MTO</b> "
"ໃນສິນຄ້າເຄິ່ງສຳເລັດຮູບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກະຕຸ້ນໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ (MO) ຍ່ອຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ທັນທີທີ່ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດຫຼັກໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>BOM Integration:</b> If your project requires multiple Bills of Materials "
"(BOMs), create them directly using the dedicated BOM button."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ BOM:</b> ຖ້າໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການໂຄງສ້າງລາຍການວັດຖຸດິບ (BOM) "
"ຫຼາຍລາຍການ, ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຜ່ານປຸ່ມ BOM ສະເພາະ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Batch Sizes:</b> Optimize production runs."
msgstr "<b>ຂະໜາດຊຸດການຜະລິດ:</b> ປັບປຸງຮອບການຜະລິດໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>By-Products:</b> Manage secondary outputs during the manufacturing "
"process."
msgstr "<b>ຜົນຜະລິດພອຍໄດ້:</b> ຄຸ້ມຄອງຜົນຜະລິດຕົກຄ້າງ ຫຼື ຜົນຜະລິດຮອງໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການຜະລິດ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>By-products:</b> Manage leftovers from production and track them as "
"valuable inventory."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຜົນຜະລິດພອຍໄດ້:</b> ຄຸ້ມຄອງວັດສະດຸເສດເຫຼືອຈາກການຜະລິດ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມເປັນສິນຄ້າຄົງຄັງທີ່ມີມູນຄ່າ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Centralized Hub:</b> Use the top menu to navigate effortlessly between "
"all elements linked to your project."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສູນກາງລວມຂໍ້ມູນ:</b> "
"ໃຊ້ເມນູດ້ານເທິງເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກພາກສ່ວນທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງສະດວກ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Centralized Updates:</b> Manage all changes and approvals within a "
"single, dedicated interface."
msgstr "<b>ການອັບເດດລວມສູນ:</b> ຄຸ້ມຄອງທຸກການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ການອະນຸມັດພາຍໃນໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Client Collaboration:</b> Share specific folders with your clients, "
"providing them with a secure, central location to upload and access vital "
"project files."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຮ່ວມມືກັບລູກຄ້າ:</b> ແບ່ງປັນໂຟນເດີສະເພາະໃຫ້ກັບລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານ, "
"ໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ສູນກາງທີ່ປອດໄພໃນການອັບໂຫຼດ ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ໂຄງການທີ່ສຳຄັນ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Definition:</b> All billable, non-tangible offerings provided to the "
"client."
msgstr "<b>ຄຳນິຍາມ:</b> ບໍລິການທີ່ບໍ່ມີຕົວຕົນທັງໝົດທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ແກ່ລູກຄ້າ ແລະ ສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ເງິນໄດ້."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Definition:</b> All components and materials sourced directly from "
"external vendors."
msgstr "<b>ຄຳນິຍາມ:</b> ຊິ້ນສ່ວນ ແລະ ວັດຖຸດິບທັງໝົດທີ່ຈັດຊື້ໂດຍກົງຈາກຜູ້ສະໜອງພາຍນອກ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Definition:</b> In-house manufactured items used as sub-assemblies for "
"larger builds rather than being sold individually."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຳນິຍາມ:</b> ສິນຄ້າທີ່ຜະລິດພາຍໃນເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນຊິ້ນສ່ວນປະກອບສຳລັບໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະນຳໄປຂາຍແຍກເປັນຊິ້ນ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Definition:</b> Sale-ready goods ranging from standardized items (fixed "
"BOMs) to fully customized solutions."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຳນິຍາມ:</b> ສິນຄ້າພ້ອມຂາຍ ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ລາຍການມາດຕະຖານ (BOM ຄົງທີ່) "
"ຈົນຮອດສິນຄ້າທີ່ສັ່ງເຮັດພິເສດຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Detailed Work Orders:</b> For every operation, you can define precise "
"timings, step-by-step instructions, and mandatory <b>Quality Checks</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໃບສັ່ງງານລະອຽດ:</b> ໃນແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນການປະຕິບັດງານ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ຊັດເຈນ, "
"ຄຳແນະນຳເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນ ແລະ <b>ການກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບ</b> ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Direct Manufacturing:</b> Launch Manufacturing Orders (MOs) from the "
"Manufacturing tab. Once confirmed, these will flow into your standard "
"manufacturing workflow. (see next section)"
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຜະລິດໂດຍກົງ:</b> ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ (MO) ຈາກແຖບການຜະລິດ. ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, "
"ລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ຂັ້ນຕອນການຜະລິດມາດຕະຖານຂອງທ່ານ. (ເບິ່ງພາກຕໍ່ໄປ)"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Easy Billing:</b> Generate a <b>Sales Order</b> directly from the repair "
"order to invoice your client for parts and labor."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນງ່າຍດາຍ:</b> ສ້າງ <b>ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ</b> ໂດຍກົງຈາກໃບສັ່ງສ້ອມແປງ "
"ເພື່ອອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນຄ່າອາໄຫຼ່ ແລະ ຄ່າແຮງງານໃຫ້ແກ່ລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Either create a project :</b> From the CRM, create a new project by "
"clicking the <b>⚙️ icon</b> and selecting a template. This project will allow "
"you to manage all the pre-sales steps, such as:"
msgstr ""
"<b>ສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່:</b> ຈາກລະບົບ CRM, ສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່ໂດຍການກົດທີ່ <b>ໄອຄອນ ⚙️</b> "
"ແລ້ວເລືອກແມ່ແບບ. ໂຄງການນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄຸ້ມຄອງທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນການຂາຍ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Either you create a Quotation from the opportunity and wait for a "
"confirmation.</b>"
msgstr "<b>ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຈາກໂອກາດທາງການຂາຍ ແລ້ວລໍຖ້າການຢືນຢັນ.</b>"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Engineering Review:</b> This proposal automatically generates an <b>ECO</"
"b> in the PLM app. Engineers can then review, test, and approve the change "
"before it is officially applied to the Bill of Materials."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການກວດສອບທາງວິສະວະກຳ:</b> ຂໍ້ສະເໜີນີ້ຈະສ້າງ <b>ECO</b> ໃນແອັບ PLM ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ຈາກນັ້ນ ວິສະວະກອນສາມາດກວດສອບ, ທົດສອບ ແລະ ອະນຸມັດການປ່ຽນແປງ "
"ກ່ອນຈະນຳໄປປັບໃຊ້ກັບໂຄງສ້າງລາຍການວັດຖຸດິບ (BOM) ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Financial Forecasting &amp; Actuals:</b> Compare estimated costs against "
"real costs directly from the project overview to maintain control over your "
"budget."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຄາດຄະເນການເງິນ &amp; ຕົວເລກຕົວຈິງ:</b> "
"ປຽບທຽບຕົ້ນທຶນປະເມີນກັບຕົ້ນທຶນຕົວຈິງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກພາບລວມໂຄງການ ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມງົບປະມານຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Flexible Timesheets:</b> Log time on individual tasks to monitor project "
"profitability or accurately bill clients for hours worked."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຕາຕະລາງບັນທຶກເວລາທີ່ຍືດຫຍຸ່ນ:</b> ບັນທຶກເວລາໃນແຕ່ລະໜ້າວຽກ ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຜົນກຳໄລຂອງໂຄງການ ຫຼື "
"ອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນຕາມຊົ່ວໂມງເຮັດວຽກຕົວຈິງໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>For example:</b> A client requests a specialized scanner capable of "
"multilingual package recognition. Within a single project, you can "
"centralize product specifications, vendor quotes, and BOM designs. You can "
"then generate an initial quotation for a <b>Proof of Concept (PoC)</b> "
"directly from the project. Once confirmed, you can continue iterating within "
"the same project—creating updated quotations and Manufacturing Orders by "
"building on previous data and new insights."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຕົວຢ່າງ:</b> ລູກຄ້າຕ້ອງການເຄື່ອງສະແກນພິເສດທີ່ສາມາດກວດຈັບພັດສະດຸຫຼາຍພາສາໄດ້. "
"ພາຍໃນໂຄງການດຽວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລວມສູນຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຂອງສິນຄ້າ, ໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຈາກຜູ້ສະໜອງ ແລະ "
"ການອອກແບບ BOM. ຈາກນັ້ນ ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຂັ້ນຕົ້ນສຳລັບ <b>ການພິສູດແນວຄິດ (PoC)</b> "
"ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກໂຄງການ. ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໃນໂຄງການດຽວກັນ—"
"ສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາທີ່ອັບເດດໃໝ່ ແລະ ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Invoice Oversight:</b> Track all related outgoing and incoming invoices "
"directly within the project interface."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການກວດກາໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ:</b> ຕິດຕາມໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນຂາອອກ ແລະ ຂາເຂົ້າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທັງໝົດ "
"ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງພາຍໃນໜ້າຕ່າງໂຄງການ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Key Benefits:</b>"
msgstr "<b>ຜົນປະໂຫຍດຫຼັກ:</b>"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>MTO (Make-to-Order) Route:</b> Use this to automatically trigger a "
"Manufacturing Order whenever a Sales Order is confirmed"
msgstr ""
"<b>ເສັ້ນທາງ MTO (ຜະລິດເມື່ອມີຄຳສັ່ງຊື້):</b> ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Make to Stock (Reordering Rules):</b> Set a <b>minimum stock level</b> "
"for your sub-assemblies. The system will automatically trigger a new MO once "
"your inventory drops below this threshold, ensuring you always have enough "
"stock on hand for future production."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຜະລິດເພື່ອເກັບສາງ (ກົດລະບຽບການສັ່ງຊື້ຄືນ):</b> ຕັ້ງຄ່າ <b>ລະດັບສິນຄ້າຄົງຄັງຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ</b> "
"ສຳລັບຊິ້ນສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງທ່ານ. ລະບົບຈະສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ເມື່ອສິນຄ້າຄົງຄັງຫຼຸດລົງຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າທ່ານມີສິນຄ້າພຽງພໍໃນສາງສຳລັບການຜະລິດໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manual Creation:</b> Generate secondary MOs for sub-assemblies manually "
"as the need arises."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການສ້າງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ:</b> ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດຍ່ອຍສຳລັບຊິ້ນສ່ວນປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ເມື່ອມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Miscellaneous Notes &amp; Integration:</b> Use the HTML field (note) in "
"the <b>Miscellaneous tab</b> for advanced instructions. You can embed links "
"to internal knowledge articles, 3D plans, or external software. Operators "
"can access these links directly from the <b>Shopfloor App</b> during "
"production."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໝາຍເຫດອື່ນໆ &amp; ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ:</b> ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ HTML (ໝາຍເຫດ) ໃນ <b>ແຖບອື່ນໆ</b> "
"ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ທ່ານສາມາດຝັງລິ້ງບົດຄວາມຄວາມຮູ້ພາຍໃນ, ແຜນແບບ 3D ຫຼື ຊອບແວພາຍນອກ. "
"ຜູ້ປະຕິບັດງານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລິ້ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກ <b>ແອັບໜ້າໂຮງງານ (Shopfloor)</b> "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຜະລິດ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Monitor Progress:</b> Visit the <b>Overview Tab</b> to see a side-by-side "
"comparison of your sales, expected costs, and real costs (derived from "
"invoices and completed Manufacturing Orders)."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ:</b> ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ <b>ແຖບພາບລວມ</b> ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບຍອດຂາຍ, ຕົ້ນທຶນຄາດຄະເນ "
"ແລະ ຕົ້ນທຶນຕົວຈິງ (ເຊິ່ງຄິດໄລ່ຈາກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ ແລະ ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ)."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Note:</b> If you validate a transfer for a partial quantity, the system "
"will automatically create a <b>backorder</b> for the rest of the items."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໝາຍເຫດ:</b> ຖ້າທ່ານຢືນຢັນການໂອນຍ້າຍບາງສ່ວນ, ລະບົບຈະສ້າງ <b>ລາຍການຄ້າງສົ່ງ "
"(backorder)</b> ສຳລັບຈຳນວນທີ່ເຫຼືອໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Organized File Sharing:</b> Create custom folders (such as \"Internal\" "
"or \"Client-Facing\") via the Documents button."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການແບ່ງປັນໄຟລ໌ຢ່າງເປັນລະບົບ:</b> ສ້າງໂຟນເດີສະເພາະ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"ພາຍໃນ\" ຫຼື \"ສຳລັບລູກຄ້າ\") "
"ຜ່ານປຸ່ມເອກະສານ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Pro Tip: Real-Time Margin Analysis</b>"
msgstr "<b>ເຄັດລັບພິເສດ: ການວິເຄາະກຳໄລສ່ວນຕ່າງແບບທັນທີ</b>"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Pro-Tip:</b> You can print and use barcode commands with a scanner to "
"automate and streamline your workflow."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເຄັດລັບພິເສດ:</b> ທ່ານສາມາດພິມ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງບາໂຄດຮ່ວມກັບເຄື່ອງສະແກນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ວ່ອງໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Proactive Quality Checks:</b> These are predefined checks (created in the "
"Quality App) that trigger automatically at specific stages of production."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບແບບເຊີງຮຸກ:</b> ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການກວດສອບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ "
"(ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນແອັບຄຸນນະພາບ) ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການຜະລິດສະເພາະ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Propose BOM Updates:</b> If a worker discovers a more efficient method or "
"a necessary adjustment, they can propose adding a new step or component."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສະເໜີການອັບເດດ BOM:</b> ຖ້າພະນັກງານພົບວິທີທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບກວ່າ ຫຼື ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບປ່ຽນ, "
"ພວກເຂົາສາມາດສະເໜີເພີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນ ຫຼື ຊິ້ນສ່ວນໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Protocol:</b> Develop detailed <b>Bills of Materials (BOMs)</b> that "
"explicitly link components to their respective production stages and "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຂັ້ນຕອນປະຕິບັດ:</b> ສ້າງ <b>ໂຄງສ້າງລາຍການວັດຖຸດິບ (BOM)</b> ລະອຽດ "
"ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງຊິ້ນສ່ວນຕ່າງໆ ເຂົ້າກັບຂັ້ນຕອນການຜະລິດ ແລະ ການປະຕິບັດງານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Protocol:</b> For new clients or projects, create a <b>unique product "
"entry</b>. Map these to a <b>Master BOM Catalog</b> to pull in reusable "
"templates; this allows for distinct database tracking while leveraging "
"standardized production logic."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຂັ້ນຕອນປະຕິບັດ:</b> ສຳລັບລູກຄ້າ ຫຼື ໂຄງການໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ <b>ລາຍການສິນຄ້າສະເພາະ</b>. "
"ເຊື່ອມໂຍງລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃສ່ <b>ລາຍການ BOM ຫຼັກ</b> ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບທີ່ໃຊ້ຊ້ຳໄດ້; "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕາມຖານຂໍ້ມູນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງນຳໃຊ້ຫຼັກການຜະລິດມາດຕະຖານໄດ້."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Protocol:</b> Maintain up-to-date <b>vendor assignments</b> and "
"<b>purchase pricing</b> to ensure procurement accuracy."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຂັ້ນຕອນປະຕິບັດ:</b> ອັບເດດ <b>ການກຳນົດຜູ້ສະໜອງ</b> ແລະ <b>ລາຄາຈັດຊື້</b> "
"ໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນສະເໝີ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການຈັດຊື້."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Reactive Quality Alerts:</b> If a worker identifies an issue on the fly, "
"they can trigger a <b>Quality Alert</b>. This creates a dedicated task in "
"the Quality App for the quality team to investigate."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄຸນນະພາບແບບທັນທີ:</b> ຖ້າພະນັກງານພົບເຫັນບັນຫາໃນຂະນະເຮັດວຽກ, "
"ພວກເຂົາສາມາດກົດ <b>ແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄຸນນະພາບ</b>. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງໜ້າວຽກສະເພາະໃນແອັບຄຸນນະພາບ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທີມງານຄຸນນະພາບກວດສອບ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Sales &amp; Purchase Orders:</b> Generate unlimited Sales Orders to "
"account for scope changes, and manage all project-specific Purchase Orders "
"in one place."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ &amp; ໃບສັ່ງຊື້:</b> ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຂາຍໄດ້ບໍ່ຈຳກັດເພື່ອຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນແປງຂອບເຂດວຽກ, ແລະ "
"ຄຸ້ມຄອງທຸກໃບສັ່ງຊື້ສະເພາະໂຄງການໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນດຽວ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Scope:</b> Includes design, consulting, installation, and long-term "
"maintenance."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຂອບເຂດ:</b> ລວມມີການອອກແບບ, ການໃຫ້ຄຳປຶກສາ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໄລຍະຍາວ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Seamless Integration:</b> Create a repair order directly from a "
"<b>Helpdesk task</b> to streamline your after-sales service."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງແບບບໍ່ມີຮອຍຕໍ່:</b> ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງສ້ອມແປງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກ <b>ໜ້າວຽກ Helpdesk</b> "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການບໍລິການຫຼັງການຂາຍວ່ອງໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Set Forecasts:</b> Manually input your expected margin on each Sales "
"Order line."
msgstr ""
"<b>ກຳນົດການຄາດຄະເນ:</b> ປ້ອນກຳໄລສ່ວນຕ່າງທີ່ຄາດຫວັງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນແຕ່ລະແຖວຂອງໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Targeted Delegation:</b> Create and assign tasks directly to the "
"appropriate team members to ensure accountability."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການມອບໝາຍວຽກຢ່າງກົງເປົ້າໝາຍ:</b> ສ້າງ ແລະ ມອບໝາຍໜ້າວຽກໃຫ້ສະມາຊິກໃນທີມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍກົງ "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Use the batch size setting:</b> If you always produce in batches of a "
"specific quantity, use the <b>Batch Size</b> setting in the "
"<b>Miscellaneous</b> tab."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຊຸດ:</b> ຖ້າທ່ານຜະລິດເປັນຊຸດຕາມຈຳນວນທີ່ແນ່ນອນສະເໝີ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"<b>ຂະໜາດຊຸດການຜະລິດ</b> ໃນແຖບ <b>ອື່ນໆ</b>."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Version Control:</b> Maintain a clear history of every BOM iteration."
msgstr "<b>ການຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ:</b> ຮັກສາປະຫວັດທີ່ຊັດເຈນຂອງທຸກໆຮອບການປັບປ່ຽນ BOM."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Work Assignments:</b> Directly assign tasks to the appropriate personnel "
"to streamline the production flow."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການມອບໝາຍວຽກ:</b> ມອບໝາຍໜ້າວຽກໃຫ້ບຸກຄະລາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍກົງ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາຍການຜະລິດດຳເນີນໄປຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Work Center Capacity:</b> Balance workloads and prevent bottlenecks based "
"on resource availability."
msgstr ""
"<b>ກຳລັງການຜະລິດຂອງສູນປະຕິບັດງານ:</b> ຈັດການພາລະວຽກໃຫ້ສົມດຸນ ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນບັນຫາວຽກຕິດຂັດ "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Work Center Capacity:</b> Optimize your production schedule by exploring "
"the capacity of your work centers."
msgstr ""
"<b>ກຳລັງການຜະລິດຂອງສູນປະຕິບັດງານ:</b> ປັບປຸງຕາຕະລາງການຜະລິດຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ "
"ໂດຍການກວດສອບກຳລັງການຜະລິດຂອງສູນປະຕິບັດງານ."

